<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπακρῑβόομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be highly wrought</i> or <i>finished,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς κάλλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					810b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος ἀπηκριβωμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					29c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				59d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					15.190
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μάλιστ᾽ ἀπηκρ.</span> the
			most <i>perfect creatures,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				666a28
			</span></i>; of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηκριβωμένος ἐπί
				τινι</span>
			<i>accurately versed</i> in a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.28
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηκριβωμένως.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>finish off, make perfect,</i> of sculpture, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.172
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aet.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.342
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ταῖς γραμμαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Im.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			).</div>
